{"role":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is an audit based on `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. How the「操作」dropdown is implemented\n\n- **Pattern:** Custom markup, not a shared dropdown component. A wrapper `div.action-menu-wrapper` holds:\n  - A **trigger**: `<button class=\"small ghost action-menu-trigger\" …>操作 ▾</button>` with `@click.stop=\"toggleActionMenu(id)\"` and `title=\"更多操作\"`.\n  - A **menu**: `<div v-if=\"activeActionMenu === id\" class=\"action-dropdown\" @click.stop>` with full-width `<button class=\"action-dropdown-item\" …>` rows (and one `<hr class=\"action-dropdown-divider\">` before delete).\n- **State:** `activeActionMenu` ref + `toggleActionMenu` / `closeActionMenu`; **outside click** closes via `document.addEventListener('click', closeActionMenu)` in lifecycle hooks (see grep around lines 2859–2862).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Confirmation before「刪除課程」\n\n**Yes.** `deleteCourse` uses the browser **`window.confirm`** (not a Vue `ConfirmModal`):\n\n```2631:2633:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue\nconst deleteCourse = async (c) => {\n  if (!confirm('確定要刪除此課程？刪除後無法復原。')) return;\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Hover / focus and revealing the button\n\n- **Row hover:** `.course-row:hover` only changes **row background** (`#f8fafc`; paused variant uses a gradient). There is **no** CSS that hides the「操作」button until hover or shows it only on focus.\n- **Focus:** No `action-menu-trigger`–specific `:focus` / `:focus-visible` rules in this file’s action-menu block; focus styling would come from global `.small` / `.ghost` if defined elsewhere.\n\nSo the trigger is **always visible** whenever the actions cell is visible; row hover does **not** reveal it.\n\n---\n\n## 4 & 6 & 7 — Count, button look, and where it renders\n\n### Main course table (active rows)\n\nThe「操作」control lives in **`td.cell-actions`**, inside `.action-btns-row`, always rendered for each active course row (`v-for=\"c in activeCourses(group)\"`). It is **not** wrapped in `v-if` (unlike some menu items inside the dropdown).\n\n**Trigger HTML:** Text label **`操作`**, Unicode **down triangle `▾`**, no separate icon component, no chevron SVG. Classes: `small ghost action-menu-trigger`.\n\n**Menu item count is not fixed** — it depends on `isSessionMode`, `c.status`, `canQuickAddSession`, and `canCloseCourse`:\n\n| # | Label(s) | Conditions / notes |\n|---|----------|-------------------|\n| 1 | `+ 新增堂次` | `v-if=\"isSessionMode(c)\"`; CSS hides row duplicate on desktop, shows in dropdown on **max-width 640px** only (`.action-dropdown-add-session-mobile`) |\n| 2 | `編輯` | Always |\n| 3 | `⚡ 續報加購` **or** `加購堂數` | Dynamic label; class `action-dropdown-renew` when session mode and remaining ≤ 2 (orange styling) |\n| 4 | `暫停課程` **or** `恢復課程` | `v-if` on status (`inactive` vs not) — **one** of these |\n| 5 | `結案（不續報）` | `v-if=\"canCloseCourse(c)\"`; class `action-dropdown-close` (amber text, yellow-tint hover) |\n| 6 | `換師複製` | Always |\n| — | `<hr class=\"action-dropdown-divider\">` | Between “safe” group and delete |\n| 7 | `刪除課程` | Always; class `action-dropdown-danger` (red text, light red hover bg) |\n\nSo you typically see **6–8** interactive items **plus** the divider **plus** delete, depending on state and viewport (mobile adds the duplicate「+ 新增堂次」in the menu).\n\n### History courses (card UI)\n\nA second「操作」block appears in **`history-course-card__actions`** (same trigger). That menu has **4** items before the divider + delete:\n\n- `編輯`\n- `恢復課程` (`action-dropdown-resume` — blue, semibold)\n- `換師複製`\n- `<hr class=\"action-dropdown-divider\">`\n- `刪除課程` (`action-dropdown-danger`)\n\n---\n\n## 5. Visual grouping (dangerous vs safe)\n\n**Yes.** An **`<hr class=\"action-dropdown-divider\">`** separates the main actions from「刪除課程」. Divider style: margin + `border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0` (see `.action-dropdown-divider`).\n\n---\n\n## Exact template — active row (button + menu)\n\n```220:257:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue\n                    <td class=\"cell-actions\">\n                      <div class=\"action-btns-row\">\n                        <button\n                          v-if=\"isSessionMode(c)\"\n                          class=\"small btn-add-session\"\n                          :class=\"{ disabled: !canQuickAddSession(c) }\"\n                          :disabled=\"!canQuickAddSession(c)\"\n                          :title=\"canQuickAddSession(c) ? '加課／補登（不增加總堂數）' : quickAddDisabledReason(c)\"\n                          @click=\"canQuickAddSession(c) && openQuickAddSessionModal(c)\"\n                        >+ 新增堂次</button>\n                        <button class=\"small ghost btn-toggle\" @click=\"toggleDates(c)\">\n                          {{ expandedDates.has(c.id) ? '收起' : '詳情' }}\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"action-menu-wrapper\">\n                          <button class=\"small ghost action-menu-trigger\" @click.stop=\"toggleActionMenu(c.id)\" title=\"更多操作\">操作 ▾</button>\n                          <div v-if=\"activeActionMenu === c.id\" class=\"action-dropdown\" @click.stop>\n                            <button\n                              v-if=\"isSessionMode(c)\"\n                              class=\"action-dropdown-item action-dropdown-add-session-mobile\"\n                              :class=\"{ 'action-dropdown-item--disabled': !canQuickAddSession(c) }\"\n                              :disabled=\"!canQuickAddSession(c)\"\n                              :title=\"canQuickAddSession(c) ? '' : quickAddDisabledReason(c)\"\n                              @click=\"canQuickAddSession(c) && (openQuickAddSessionModal(c), closeActionMenu())\"\n                            >+ 新增堂次</button>\n                            <button class=\"action-dropdown-item\" @click=\"editCourse(c); closeActionMenu()\">編輯</button>\n                            <button\n                              :class=\"['action-dropdown-item', { 'action-dropdown-renew': isSessionMode(c) && Number(displayRemainingSessions(c) ?? 0) <= 2 }]\"\n                              @click=\"openPurchaseModal(c); closeActionMenu()\"\n                            >{{ isSessionMode(c) && Number(displayRemainingSessions(c) ?? 0) <= 2 ? '⚡ 續報加購' : '加購堂數' }}</button>\n                            <button v-if=\"c.status !== 'inactive'\" class=\"action-dropdown-item\" @click=\"toggleCoursePause(c); closeActionMenu()\">暫停課程</button>\n                            <button v-if=\"c.status === 'inactive'\" class=\"action-dropdown-item action-dropdown-resume\" @click=\"toggleCoursePause(c); closeActionMenu()\">恢復課程</button>\n                            <button v-if=\"canCloseCourse(c)\" class=\"action-dropdown-item action-dropdown-close\" @click=\"closeCourseNoRenew(c); closeActionMenu()\">結案（不續報）</button>\n                            <button class=\"action-dropdown-item\" @click=\"duplicateCourseForTeacher(c); closeActionMenu()\">換師複製</button>\n                            <hr class=\"action-dropdown-divider\" />\n                            <button class=\"action-dropdown-item action-dropdown-danger\" @click=\"deleteCourse(c); closeActionMenu()\">刪除課程</button>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </td>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Visual treatment summary (CSS in same file)\n\n- **Default items:** `#334155` text; hover `#f1f5f9` background (`.action-dropdown-item:hover`).\n- **`action-dropdown-resume`:** `#2563eb`, `font-weight: 600`.\n- **`action-dropdown-close`:** `#92400e`; hover bg `#fef3c7`.\n- **`action-dropdown-danger`:** `#dc2626`; hover bg `#fef2f2`.\n- **`action-dropdown-renew`:** `#e65100`, bold (low-sessions “續報” emphasis).\n- **Disabled mobile add:** `.action-dropdown-item--disabled` opacity `0.45`, `cursor: not-allowed`.\n- **Dropdown panel:** white bg, border, shadow, `border-radius: 10px`, short fade animation.\n\n---\n\n## ConfirmModal / project-wide patterns\n\n- **No** file named `ConfirmModal` under `frontend/src/` (glob found none).\n- Confirmations in this page mix **`confirm()`** (including delete) and **inline `modal-overlay` modals** for features like edit / duplicate intercept / various `*Modal.vue` components.\n- Broader search: many `modal-overlay` usages across pages; **delete course specifically uses native `confirm`**, not a shared modal component.\n\n---\n\n### If you truly need “6 action items” as a fixed checklist\n\nThe **main** dropdown does **not** have a fixed count of six: it varies. A **minimal** history dropdown is **5** actions (4 + delete). For a **typical** active row without「結案」and not paused, you might see **5** items before the divider (`編輯`, `加購堂數`, `暫停課程`, `換師複製`, plus optional mobile `+ 新增堂次`) — still not a hard “6” without counting conditionals.\n\n[REDACTED]"}]}}